# Commits that changed formatting and nothing else. `git blame` skips them, so
# a line's blame points at whoever wrote it rather than at the reformat.
#
# Enable it once per clone:
#
#     git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# GitHub reads this file by name and needs no configuration.
#
# Only ever add a commit that a reviewer has confirmed is purely mechanical —
# a commit listed here is invisible in blame, so a behaviour change hidden in
# one is a behaviour change nobody can find.

